.TH RF-COPY 1 "August 2026" "rf-clipboard" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rf-copy \- copy stdin to an encrypted shared clipboard (alias for rf-clip)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B command
|
.B rf-copy
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rf-copy
is an alias for
.BR rf-clip (1):
it encrypts standard input on your device and uploads it to the shared
clipboard server. Retrieve it on any of your devices with
.BR rf-paste (1).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
.RS
$ echo 'hello world' | rf-copy
$ rf-paste
hello world
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rf-clip (1),
.BR rf-paste (1)
